.TH GREENCRYPT 1 "2026-10-19" "GreenCrypt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
greencrypt \- AES-256-EAX file and folder encryption tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B greencrypt
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ target ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B greencrypt
encrypts and decrypts files and folders using AES-256 in EAX mode.
Each encrypted file gets a random 16-byte salt and nonce, and the key is
derived from the password with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 using 200000 iterations.
.PP
When run without arguments, it launches the graphical interface if the
.B greencrypt-gui
package is installed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-encrypt
Encrypt the target file or folder.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-decrypt
Decrypt the target file or folder.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-interactive
Run the interactive command-line menu instead of the graphical interface.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-password " " \fIPASSWORD\fR
Use \fIPASSWORD\fR as the password.
Warning: the password is visible in the process list and shell history.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-file " " \fIFILE\fR
Read the password from the first line of \fIFILE\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-delete
Delete the original file or folder after processing.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a help message and exit.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I target
File or folder to encrypt or decrypt.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B greencrypt \-e \-p 'secret' photo.jpg
Encrypt \fIphoto.jpg\fR.
.TP
.B greencrypt \-d \-p 'secret' photo.jpg.aes
Decrypt \fIphoto.jpg.aes\fR.
.TP
.B greencrypt \-e \-f pass.txt documents/
Encrypt the \fIdocuments\fR folder using the password stored in \fIpass.txt\fR.
.TP
.B greencrypt \-e \-p 'secret' \-\-delete secret.txt
Encrypt \fIsecret.txt\fR and delete the original.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I file.aes
Encrypted output. The format contains a magic header, a random salt,
a nonce, an authentication tag and the ciphertext.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR greencrypt-gui (1)
